  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judicial Administration Improvement Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Mejoramiento Administracin de Justicia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WOULD CONSIST OF: (I) DEVELOPMENT OF A JUDICIARY INFORMATION SYSTME TO IMPROVE DECISION MAKING; (II) MODERNIZATION OF THE ADMINISTRATIVE SYSTEM OF THE SECTOR; (III) IMPROVEMENT OF CONTINUING JUDICIARY EDUCATION PROGRAMS; (IV) IMPLEMENTATION OF ALTERNATIVE SYSTEMS FOR THE SOLUTION OF CONFLICTS AND DISPUTES; AND (V) STRENGTHENING THE MECHANISMS THAT WOULD GUARANTEE WIDE ACCESS BY THE CITIZENS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
